  "title": "Samsung dryer",
  "revisionid": 1342174,
  "contents_raw": "== Background ==\n\nSamsung first released dryers in the 1970s along with washing machines and other home appliances. Today, Samsung dryers often come equipped with MultiSteam and SensorDry technology.\n\n== Identification ==\n\nThe model number can be found inside the dryer, around the drum. Common models include the DVE45T6000W, DVE50R8500V, and DV90T8240SH.\n\n== Additional Information ==\n\n* [link|https://www.samsung.com/us/support/downloads/|Samsung Dryer Model Number Lookup|new_window=true]\n* [link|https://www.samsung.com/us/support/downloads/|Samsung Owner's Manuals|new_window=true]\n* ***Samsung Customer Support Phone Number:*** 1-800-726-7864 (1-800-SAMSUNG)\n** Get help via text: message \"SUPPORT\" to 1-800-726-7864.",
